WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.180
Price screens, banners and promotion spaces for an advertiser and save the quote as a campaign.

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:13.520
Advertising sells the mall's screens, banners, promotion spaces and car display spots.

3
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:19.820
You see this month's revenue, how full the spaces are, and what needs attention.

4
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.750
Choose Build a quote.

5
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.120
Choose the advertiser and name the campaign.

6
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:39.590
Tick the spaces. Busy dates show as taken, so you never double-book.

7
00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.520
Choose Update the price.

8
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:52.980
The quote applies the rate card, the season and any package discount.

9
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.770
Choose Save as a proposal.

10
00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:02.530
The campaign moves from proposal to confirmed, artwork approved, live and ended.

11
00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:11.450
Hold the spaces while the client decides, then confirm the booking and raise the invoice. Print the proposal from the top.

12
00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:16.590
The Calendar tab shows every space week by week, booked and free.
